        <mxCell id="footer-3" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:21.60px&quot;&gt;Note: deny-all ingress -- the launcher never connects to a sandbox; the session and the environment key arrive through the SandboxClaim env, not the network.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:22.40px&quot;&gt;Note: enforced on the node in eBPF on the pod's host-side veth, outside the guest, so a command the model runs inside the sandbox cannot change it.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:21.60px&quot;&gt;Note: domainNames allows the IP addresses a host resolves to, so a different name on the same addresses would also be reachable.&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=-1.477;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#232F3E;fontFamily=Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacingLeft=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
